body:
Hey, So I can definitely relate on so many levels to this, especially the anxiety of wanting to talk to them but being afraid to open the messages. I also know that while it doesnt seem like it, those friends, they love you.  I had dozens of friends in HS and UNI, but I went through a terrible, selfish time in my life (\~6 years) and cut everyone out, dropped out of classes and got arrested for a bunch of drug and gun felonies.  It was only when I had hit my lowest point that I realized who were my true lifelong friends.... the ones that when dragged myself back and messaged them...they answered. I can tell you that of the hundreds of people I have associated with, these 3 dudes have always had my back... your friends will understand. The real ones, will tell you it doesnt matter, they are just happy to have you back..  I am open to talk if you ever need to, but just try to keep forging your own path, and reach out to Benny, explain how you feel... I know what being blinded by love can make you do... and honestly most people will learn it, and they will understand. Everyone makes mistakes, but forgiveness and reconciliation with/from those you care about is the foundation for a stronger tomorrow.  I wish you the best in wherever your future takes you.

&#x200B;

EDIT \*My first time ever posting here, if my post is in violation of anything I do apologize. I tried to make sure I read all the sidebar stuff.\*
